        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Diesel and diesel engine\n\n# Included processes\nThis dataset represents the combustion of 1 MJ in an average hydraulic digger in Switzerland. The building machine is not included. Crawler and wheeled excavators with a mechanical power of 75-130 kW are included. This corresponds to an average excavation capacity of about 100 m3/h. The dataset refers to the entire transport life cycle i.e. to the production, operation, maintenance and end of life of vehicle.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
        </technology>
